    "conclusion": "If your gate is still not latching properly or is sagging, you may need to disassemble your gate again and adjust the alignment or height of your hinges until the gate latches properly.\nIf the problem persists, it’s possible that your post wasn’t installed correctly, your fence may be experiencing pressure from structures leaning on it, or your nuts and bolts may be worn and deficient. These problems will require additional procedures.",
